     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Unless a smaller digit precedes a larger digit, add the digit’s values.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Add the digit values: 50 + 10 + 10 + 5 + 1 + 1 = 77</p>"
    },
