     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Unless a smaller digit precedes a larger digit, add the digit’s values.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>L</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Subtract 10 from 50<br>\n50 – 10 = 40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>100 + 100 + 40</p>\n<p>240</p>"
    },
