     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Unless a smaller digit precedes a larger digit, add the digit’s values.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Subtract 100 from 500.<br>\n500 – 100 = 400</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Subtract 10 from 50.<br>\n50 – 10 = 40</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>1,000 + 1,000 + 1,000 + 400 + 40 + 5 + 1 + 1</p>\n<p>3,447</p>"
    },
    {
